{"id":"2570c1d198fdad1d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/858_乘法线性逻辑_MLL.md","title":"858 乘法线性逻辑 MLL","display":"858_乘法线性逻辑_MLL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\{p^+:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\\cup\\{p^-:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Lit}=\\{p^+:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\\cup\\{p^-:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial(p^+)=p^-\">\\(\\partial(p^+)=p^-\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial(p^-)=p^+\">\\(\\partial(p^-)=p^+\\)</span>。MLL 的原始公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与对偶\">2. 公式与对偶</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lit}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lit}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{par}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{par}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{lit}(\\partial(a)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}^\\perp=\\operatorname{bot},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}^\\perp=\\operatorname{one},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{lit}(\\partial(a)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}^\\perp=\\operatorname{bot},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}^\\perp=\\operatorname{one},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{par}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{tensor}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{par}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{tensor}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由原子、替换与-α-等价\">3. 自由原子、替换与 α 等价</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(p^+)=p\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(p^+)=p\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(p^-)=p\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(p^-)=p\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{lit}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{lit}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{one})\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{bot})\n=\n\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{one})\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{bot})\n=\n\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{par}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{par}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给出。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(p^+)=\\sigma(p)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(p^+)=\\sigma(p)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(p^-)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(p^-)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{tensor}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{par}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{tensor}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{par}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)=p_m,\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p_i\\notin X\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)=p_m,\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p_i\\notin X\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>。对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{lit}(\\rho(p)^+).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{lit}(\\rho(p)^+).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{MLL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{MLL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-上下文与相继式\">4. 上下文与相继式</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\{A:\\Gamma(A)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\{A:\\Gamma(A)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta\\)</span> 为逐点和，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A=\\Gamma\\uplus\\mathbf 1_A\">\\(\\Gamma,A=\\Gamma\\uplus\\mathbf 1_A\\)</span>。相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-规则关系\">5. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})^n\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})^n\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为有限前提列集合。每个规则族均是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的子集。定义初始相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash A,A^\\perp:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\vdash\\operatorname{one}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash A,A^\\perp:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\vdash\\operatorname{one}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系由下列集合并成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}=\\{(();\\vdash A,A^\\perp):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}=\\{(();\\vdash A,A^\\perp):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,A^\\perp));\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,A^\\perp));\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,B));\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta,\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,B));\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta,\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A,B));\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{par}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A,B));\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{par}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{1}=\\{(();\\vdash\\operatorname{one})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{1}=\\{(();\\vdash\\operatorname{one})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma));\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{bot}:\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma));\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{bot}:\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明树\">6. 证明树</h1>\n<p>定义有限有根树为三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T,r,\\prec)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\ne r\">\\(u\\ne r\\)</span> 有唯一父节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\prec v\">\\(u\\prec v\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1}\">\\(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1}\\)</span> 为节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点列。</p>\n<p>MLL 证明树是四元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>，并且每个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"初始叶节点\">初始叶节点</h3>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 没有直接子节点，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h3 id=\"规则节点\">规则节点</h3>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1}\">\\(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\n\\in\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\n\\in\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\text{ 是 MLL 证明树且根标号为 }\\vdash\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\text{ 是 MLL 证明树且根标号为 }\\vdash\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可导关系\">7. 可导关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Gamma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\Gamma)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Gamma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\Gamma)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义以相继式为参数的证明对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(Q)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\text{ 是 MLL 证明树且根标号为 }Q\\},\n\\qquad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(Q)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\text{ 是 MLL 证明树且根标号为 }Q\\},\n\\qquad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义句法结构载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>，定义句法满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ\\in X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ\\in X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义闭包谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\subseteq X\n\\ \\wedge\\\n\\forall \\Pi\\in(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigl((\\Pi,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\wedge\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi)\\subseteq X\\Rightarrow Q\\in X\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\subseteq X\n\\ \\wedge\\\n\\forall \\Pi\\in(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigl((\\Pi,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\wedge\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi)\\subseteq X\\Rightarrow Q\\in X\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义句法后承：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)\\Rightarrow X\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)\\Rightarrow X\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>MLL 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}\\},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}\\},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该对象记录 MLL 只含乘法单位、乘法连接词和文字对偶；不含加法、指数、弱化或收缩规则。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{At},\n\\mathsf{Lit},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{At},\n\\mathsf{Lit},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含乘法线性逻辑句法、多重集相继式、规则关系、证明树、句法满足、闭包后承和可导关系；不含加法、指数或外延语义模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与对偶","text":"2. 公式与对偶","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由原子、替换与-α-等价","text":"3. 自由原子、替换与 α 等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-上下文与相继式","text":"4. 上下文与相继式","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则关系","text":"5. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明树","text":"6. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"初始叶节点","text":"初始叶节点","level":3},{"id":"规则节点","text":"规则节点","level":3},{"id":"7.-可导关系","text":"7. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\{p^+:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\\cup\\{p^-:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\partial(p^+)=p^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial(p^-)=p^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lit}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{par}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{lit}(\\partial(a)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}^\\perp=\\operatorname{bot},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}^\\perp=\\operatorname{one},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{par}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{tensor}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{base}(p^+)=p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{base}(p^-)=p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{lit}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{one})\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{bot})\n=\n\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{par}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(p^+)=\\sigma(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(p^-)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}","display":true},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bot},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{tensor}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{par}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex"